graph","text":"いや本当にそう思うくらい顔が髪の毛で隠れてて見つからない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わ！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見えたよー！！！！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ざきっち！！！♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんわかりますか？この幅数センチしか出ていないお顔！\nわかりましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの楽しそうな私の顔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのとき放送したようにザキさんの顔はいつも出てないのです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ざきっちには前もってブログの内容と写真を説明したら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニコニコしてどんなんですかーって言ってたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしといてな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってニコニコしちゃいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ざきっちはきっといじられて喜ぶタイプなのだと確信しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このブログを見た後のざきっちがなんと言って来るか私は楽しみです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"t